    <bpmn:process id="W_W4220" name="W4220. Account Segmentation, Tiering &amp; Coverage Plan" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Segmentation cycle; new accounts; strategy (W4217)
Frequency: Annual + periodic refresh
Volume: ~5,200 trade accounts + ~200 corporate accounts + prospects
Owner: Sales Operations / Key Accounts (VS-107)
Participants: Trade Sales (VS-11), Trade-Pro (VS-43), Analytics (VS-28), CDP (VS-126)
Source: workflow W4220 — Account Segmentation, Tiering &amp; Coverage Plan</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4220_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4220_Lane1" name="Sales Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4220_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4220_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4220_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4220_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4220_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4220_Start3" name="Segmentation cycle; new accounts; strategy (W4217)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4220_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4220_Task4" name="Sales Ops/Analytics segment and tier accounts (by revenue, potential, strategic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Ops/Analytics segment and tier accounts (by revenue, potential, strategic value, project pipeline) — e.g., strategic (named, VS-107) / key / growth / maintenance / digital-only — using CDP (VS-126)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Analytics
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4220_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4220_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4220_Task5" name="Sales Ops define the coverage plan per tier (call-frequency, channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Ops define the coverage plan per tier (call-frequency, channel, contact-owner) — strategic/key via field rep, growth via rep+digital, maintenance/digital via portal (VS-11) — aligned to W4222
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Trade Sales
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4220_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4220_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4220_Task6" name="Sales Ops assign accounts to coverage, manage tier movements…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Ops assign accounts to coverage, manage tier movements (promotion/demotion), and monitor coverage adherence (W4232)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Regional Mgrs
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4220_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4220_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
