      <bpmn:userTask id="W4221_Task4" name="Sales Ops/Finance set territory/rep quotas from the B2B revenue plan…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Ops/Finance set territory/rep quotas from the B2B revenue plan (VS-33/VS-101 MFP), account potential (W4220), and historical performance, with bottom-up validation by regional managers
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Finance / Regional Mgrs
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
