        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Ops/Comp design the incentive link (quota attainment → comp, links to VS-102.3 variable pay), test for fairness/attainability, and align to capacity (W4218)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Comp
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4221_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4221_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4221_Task6" name="Sales Ops cascade quotas to reps, manage quarterly adjustments (market shift…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Ops cascade quotas to reps, manage quarterly adjustments (market shift, territory change), and track attainment (W4233)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Regional Mgrs
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4221_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4221_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
