    <bpmn:process id="W_W4222" name="W4222. Route-to-Market &amp; Channel Assignment (Field vs Digital vs Store)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Coverage model (W4217); channel strategy; account need
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: ~5,400 B2B accounts × channel assignment
Owner: Head of Field Sales / Commercial Operations
Participants: Trade Sales (VS-11), Digital (VS-10), Store Ops (VS-07), Key Accounts (VS-107)
Source: workflow W4222 — Route-to-Market &amp; Channel Assignment (Field vs Digital vs Store)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4222_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4222_Lane1" name="Head of Field Sales">
