        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4222_Start4" name="Coverage model (W4217); channel strategy; account need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4222_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4222_Task5" name="Field Sales/Commercial define the route-to-market per segment (field rep…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Field Sales/Commercial define the route-to-market per segment (field rep, digital/self-service portal VS-11, store VS-07, phone/inside-sales, partner), and the channel-assignment rules
Responsible (R): Head of Field Sales / Commercial Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4222_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4222_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4222_Task6" name="Field Sales define channel-interaction rules (who leads on a multi-channel…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Field Sales define channel-interaction rules (who leads on a multi-channel account, lead handoff field↔digital↔store), and prevent conflict (links to VS-126 single customer view)
Responsible (R): Head of Field Sales / Trade Sales / Digital
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4222_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4222_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4222_Task7" name="Field Sales assign accounts to RTM, monitor channel mix/effectiveness (W4232)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Field Sales assign accounts to RTM, monitor channel mix/effectiveness (W4232), and reallocate as behavior shifts (e.g., digital-ready accounts moved to portal)
Responsible (R): Sales Ops / Commercial Ops
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4222_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4222_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4222_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4222_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
