      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New hire (VS-121/VS-19.1); ongoing enablement; product launch
Frequency: On hire + continuous
Volume: Field-sales force onboarding + ongoing skill-building
Owner: Field Sales Enablement Lead / Sales Enablement (VS-124) / L&amp;D (VS-19.4)
Participants: L&amp;D (VS-19.4), Sales Enablement (VS-124), Merchandising (VS-01), Trade Specialists
Source: workflow W4223 — Field Sales Onboarding, Enablement &amp; Certification</bpmn:documentation>
