      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4223_Task4" name="Enablement run structured onboarding for new field reps (product knowledge…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Enablement run structured onboarding for new field reps (product knowledge, consultative/spec selling, estimating/quoting, CRM/tools, compliance ABC links to VS-86.3), building on VS-124
Responsible (R): Field Sales Enablement Lead / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Per hire (~2–4 wks)</bpmn:documentation>
