        <bpmn:outgoing>W4223_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4223_Task5" name="Enablement/Merchandising run ongoing enablement (new products VS-01.1…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enablement/Merchandising run ongoing enablement (new products VS-01.1, spec/technical updates, competitive intel VS-33.3, selling skills VS-124), and certify reps on categories/specialties
Responsible (R): Field Sales Enablement Lead / Merchandising
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4223_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4223_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4223_Task6" name="Enablement measure rep competency/certification, coach underperformers (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Enablement measure rep competency/certification, coach underperformers (links to VS-124, VS-103), and refresh on market/product change
Responsible (R): Field Sales Enablement Lead / Regional Mgrs
Accountable (A): Head of Field Sales
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4223_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4223_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
