    <bpmn:process id="W_W4224" name="W4224. Field Sales Tooling, CRM &amp; Mobility Platform" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Tooling review; platform upgrade; strategy (W4217)
Frequency: Per lifecycle + continuous operation
Volume: Field-sales tooling for the whole force (mobile CRM, route, quoting, content)
Owner: Field Sales Ops / Sales Technology / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113)
Participants: IT (VS-27), EA (VS-113), InfoSec (VS-27.3), Digital (VS-10), TBM (VS-135)
Source: workflow W4224 — Field Sales Tooling, CRM &amp; Mobility Platform</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4224_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4224_Lane1" name="Sales Tech">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4224_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4224_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4224_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4224_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4224_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4224_Start3" name="Tooling review; platform upgrade; strategy (W4217)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4224_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4224_Task4" name="Sales Tech/EA/IT define the field-sales tooling stack (mobile CRM, route/call…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Sales Tech/EA/IT define the field-sales tooling stack (mobile CRM, route/call planning, estimating/quoting, product/content access VS-137, order entry VS-11), and the mobile/offline requirements
Responsible (R): Sales Tech / EA / IT
Accountable (A): CIO / Head of Field Sales
Duration: Per lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4224_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4224_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4224_Task5" name="Sales Tech/IT deploy and integrate the stack (CRM↔ERP↔CDP↔PIM, mobile/offline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sales Tech/IT deploy and integrate the stack (CRM↔ERP↔CDP↔PIM, mobile/offline, security VS-27.3), and train reps (W4223)
Responsible (R): Sales Tech / IT / Enablement
Accountable (A): Sales Tech
Duration: Per deployment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4224_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4224_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4224_Task6" name="Sales Tech/IT govern the platform lifecycle (roadmap, adoption, cost via VS-135…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sales Tech/IT govern the platform lifecycle (roadmap, adoption, cost via VS-135 TBM, data quality), and optimize based on rep feedback/analytics (W4232)
Responsible (R): Sales Tech / IT / EA
Accountable (A): CIO / Head of Field Sales
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4224_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4224_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4224_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4224_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4224_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-650 (ensure controlled execution — Field Sales Strategy, Territory &amp; Force Design (PA-140.1).) | - CTL-650: tooling security/privacy assessed (VS-27.3/VS-91); adoption monitored; cost governed (VS-135)
Owner: Field Sales Ops / Sales Technology / IT (VS-27) / EA (VS-113)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
